Package: ahcp
Title: Assisted Housing Condition Panel: Read and Rebuild HUD Inspection Histories
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Ayishatu", "Ameen", email = "ameenayishatu4@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads the Assisted Housing Condition Panel (AHCP) release tables and rebuilds the
    inspection panel from the physical inspection score files published by the U.S. Department of
    Housing and Urban Development. Mirrors the reference Python pipeline shipped with the dataset.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: data.table (>= 1.14), readxl (>= 1.4), utils
Suggests: jsonlite
